            <title>[LU-20558] utils: tunefs.lustre unconditionally sets autodegrade=on on a ZFS OST</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20558</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;On a ZFS OST, tunefs.lustre unconditionally appends "autodegrade=on" to the target parameters. As a result it silently discards an autodegrade value given on the command line.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
